#
# Cloudflare Pages `_headers` for the blender-web static bundle.
#
# WHY COOP/COEP: the module is built `-pthread` (SharedArrayBuffer) so it needs a
# cross-origin-isolated context. Without BOTH of these on the top-level document,
# `crossOriginIsolated` is false, `SharedArrayBuffer` is undefined, and the wasm
# aborts before WM_main (GOAL.md "Hosting: COOP/COEP everywhere"). Verify at
# runtime with `self.crossOriginIsolated === true`.
#
# WHY CORP: with COEP `require-corp`, every subresource the document pulls
# (blender_browser.{js,wasm,data} and the same-file pthread `new Worker`) must be
# eligible to load in an isolated context. All bundle assets are same-origin, so
# `Cross-Origin-Resource-Policy: same-origin` satisfies the check. (If any asset
# ever moves to a separate CDN origin, that origin must send CORP: cross-origin
# AND the fetch must be crossorigin/anonymous; keep everything same-origin to
# avoid that.)
#
# Cloudflare Pages merges all matching rule blocks, so the isolation headers under
# `/*` apply to `/bin/*` too; the per-type blocks below only ADD Content-Type and
# Cache-Control. Cloudflare Pages already infers `application/wasm` for `.wasm` and
# `text/javascript` for `.js` from the extension and brotli-compresses compressible
# types at the edge automatically (see README "MIME + brotli"); the explicit
# Content-Type lines are belt-and-braces because `X-Content-Type-Options: nosniff`
# forbids sniffing and `WebAssembly.instantiateStreaming` REJECTS anything whose
# Content-Type is not exactly `application/wasm`.

/*
  Cross-Origin-Opener-Policy: same-origin
  Cross-Origin-Embedder-Policy: require-corp
  Cross-Origin-Resource-Policy: same-origin
  X-Content-Type-Options: nosniff
  Referrer-Policy: no-referrer
  X-Frame-Options: DENY
  Permissions-Policy: camera=(), microphone=(), geolocation=(), payment=(), usb=()
  Content-Security-Policy: default-src 'self'; script-src 'self' 'wasm-unsafe-eval'; style-src 'self' 'unsafe-inline'; img-src 'self' data:; connect-src 'self'; worker-src 'self' blob:; object-src 'none'; base-uri 'none'; frame-ancestors 'none'; form-action 'none'

/bin/*.wasm
  Content-Type: application/wasm
  Cache-Control: no-cache, must-revalidate

/bin/*.data
  Content-Type: application/octet-stream
  Cache-Control: no-cache, must-revalidate

/bin/*.js
  Content-Type: text/javascript; charset=utf-8
  Cache-Control: public, max-age=31536000, immutable

/fonts/*.woff2
  Content-Type: font/woff2
  Cache-Control: public, max-age=31536000, immutable
